cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the accompanying paper (preferred citation below) and this archive."
title: "APTOS 2019 leakage audit: duplicate groups, duplicate-aware splits and reproduction code"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for a code-level audit of data leakage in diabetic retinopathy classifiers developed
  and tested on the APTOS 2019 Blindness Detection dataset. Contents: a duplicate-audit tool with a
  synthetic validation set; the duplicate groups found among the 3,662 labeled images (131 groups,
  270 images, 37 groups with conflicting grades) and the manual review of sampled pairs;
  duplicate-aware split files; the study-selection protocol, PRISMA counts, screening sheets and
  leakage coding of 12 studies with public code; instrumentation patches and run scripts for three
  reproduced studies (DiffMIC, nnMobileNet and a graph-enhanced MobileViT classifier); per-run
  results, per-image predictions of the graph-based reruns, and the analysis and figure scripts.
  No images are included.
